{
  "_comment": "D-02 (2026-10-14): SD-JWT VC counterpart of FarmerCredential. Registered with scripts/add-credential-config.ps1 (POST /v1/certify/credential-configurations on localhost:8090). vcTemplate is base64-encoded by the script. Certify adds vct, cnf (holder did:jwk) and iss. Every claim except farmerID is selectively disclosable. Revised 2026-10-14 21:50: face removed from the template (still listed in sdJwtClaims so offers carrying the CSV face column validate). Inji Wallet 0.22.1 forces Share with selfie for any SD-JWT with a face but reads the reference face only from credential.credentialSubject (ldp_vc layout, openID4VPSelectors.ts:81), so face matching always fails for SD-JWT.",
  "credentialConfigKeyId": "FarmerCredentialSdJwt",
  "credentialFormat": "vc+sd-jwt",
  "sdJwtVct": "FarmerCredentialSdJwt",
  "scope": "farmer_vc_sd_jwt",
  "didUrl": "did:web:ssi-issuer.arlabsnepal.com",
  "keyManagerAppId": "CERTIFY_VC_SIGN_EC_R1",
  "keyManagerRefId": "EC_SECP256R1_SIGN",
  "signatureAlgo": "ES256",
  "sdClaim": "$.fullName,$.mobileNumber,$.dateOfBirth,$.gender,$.state,$.district,$.villageOrTown,$.postalCode,$.landArea,$.landOwnershipType,$.primaryCropType,$.secondaryCropType",
